---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/sayantan-studio.jpg';
---

<Base
  title="About · Sayantan Dutta"
  description="UX & Service Designer working where complexity meets clarity. 5 years across enterprise SaaS, industrial safety, and API platforms."
  activeNav="about"
>

<div class="about-wrap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">

      <!-- Photo column -->
      <div>
        <div class="about-photo reveal">
          <Image src={portrait} alt="Sayantan Dutta" class="about-photo-img" loading="eager" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content column -->
      <div>
        <span class="t-label">About</span>
        <p class="about-intro reveal" style="transition-delay:.1s;">
          I'm a UX and Service Designer who works best where <em>complexity meets clarity</em>, turning systems that are genuinely difficult into experiences that feel obvious.
        </p>

        <div class="about-block reveal">
          <p class="about-block-lbl">Background</p>
          <p class="t-body">
            My path into UX started with a Bachelor's in Communication Design, where I realised design wasn't about making things beautiful. It was about making decisions visible. That instinct led me to Tata Consultancy Services, where I spent four years designing across enterprise SaaS, manufacturing technology, and API platforms for clients including Ericsson, McAfee, and Sherwin-Williams.
          </p>
          <p class="t-body" style="margin-top:.75rem;">
            Working at that scale, on platforms with complex stakeholder structures and tight compliance requirements, taught me that good UX is as much about operational rigour as it is about craft. I moved to the UK in 2024 to do an MA in Design Management at Southampton University, which sharpened how I think about design strategy and leading at a systems level.
          </p>
          <p class="t-body" style="margin-top:.75rem;">
            Most recently I led UX strategy for HAZOP Edge at Soter Safety Consulting, a platform for industrial hazard and operability studies. It was my most technically demanding project, and the one I'm most proud of.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block reveal">
          <p class="about-block-lbl">What I do</p>
          <p class="t-body">
            I specialise in enterprise and B2B UX, the kind of platforms where workflows are high-stakes, the users are domain experts, and ambiguity is expensive. I bridge design operations and hands-on craft: I can build a design system and lead scrum ceremonies in the same week.
          </p>
          <p class="t-body" style="margin-top:.75rem;">
            I prioritise clarity, accessibility, and measurable outcomes over aesthetic novelty. I've collaborated with product owners, engineers, safety professionals, and enterprise clients across Europe, the US, and the UK.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block reveal">
          <p class="about-block-lbl">Currently</p>
          <p class="t-body">
            Based in the UK. MA in Design Management from the University of Southampton, graduated September 2025. Actively looking for Lead UX, Senior UX, or Design Operations roles in product-led companies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block reveal">
          <p class="about-block-lbl">Tools &amp; Skills</p>
          <p class="t-body">
            Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, Miro, ServiceNow, Microsoft 365. UX research, usability testing, heuristic evaluation, design systems, service blueprinting, information architecture, agile / scrum.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-block reveal">
          <p class="about-block-lbl">Outside of work</p>
          <p class="t-body">
            Badminton, football, Ultimate Frisbee. Learning German (slowly). Always looking for a good flat white.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-cta reveal">
          <a href="mailto:sayantan7dutta@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">
            Get in touch <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sayantan-dutta-968033105/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</Base>

<style>
.about-wrap {
  padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem));
  padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem);
}
.about-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 5rem;
  align-items: start;
}
.about-photo {
  aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  position: sticky;
  top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem);
}
.about-photo-img {
  width: 100%; height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  filter: grayscale(20%);
  transition: filter .4s;
}
.about-photo:hover .about-photo-img { filter: grayscale(0%); }
.about-photo-ph {
  width: 100%; height: 100%;
  background: var(--surface-2);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.about-photo-ph span {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: .62rem;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-3);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 2rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.about-intro {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--text-1);
  margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
}
.about-intro em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
.about-block {
  padding: 1.75rem 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.about-block:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.about-block-lbl {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: .62rem;
  letter-spacing: .12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-3);
  margin-bottom: .875rem;
}
.about-cta {
  margin-top: 2.5rem;
  display: flex;
  gap: .75rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .about-photo { max-width: 280px; position: static; }
}
</style>
